<title>AZERBAIJAN: Azerbaijan's February inflation slows to 0.6 pct.</title>
<headline>Azerbaijan's February inflation slows to 0.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BAKU 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Azerbaijan's monthly consumer price inflation slowed to 0.6 percent in February after a 1.7 percent rise in January, the State Statistics Committee said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    AZERI CONSUMER PRICES	Feb '97    Jan '97   Feb '96</p>
<p>    Monthly pct change	   +0.6	 +1.7	+3.1</p>
<p>    Year-on-year pct change    +3.9	 +6.4     +35.0</p>
<p>--Tbilisi Newsroom (+995 32) 983 961</p>
</text>
